{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16898","headline":"兵行褒斜谷作 · 武元衡","name":"兵行褒斜谷作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古地接龟沙，边风送征鴈。\n霜明草正腓，峰逼日易晏。\n集旅布嵌谷，驱马历层涧。\n岷河源涉屡，蜀甸途行惯。\n矢橐弧室岂领军，儋爵食禄由从宦。\n注意奏凯赴都畿，速令提兵还石坂。\n三川顿使气象清，卖刀买犊消忧患。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}